=85 Conversational interface with an AI companion</div></li><li><div class=
=3D"paragraph">=E2=9C=85 Natural language =E2=86=92 intent parsing =E2=86=
=92 environment changes (wall colors, etc.)</div></li><li><div class=3D"par=
agraph">=E2=9C=85 Memory objects that can be placed and hold meaning</div><=
/li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">=E2=9C=85 Object interaction (tap to view =
memory, companion responds)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">=E2=9C=
=85 Simulated spatial memory system (context-aware responses based on room =
