">https://eyj2tr5qyvtok.kimi.page</a></div><h3>What was built</h3><div clas=
s=3D"paragraph">This is a <strong>Phase 1 MVP prototype</strong> of OurHome=
 =E2=80=94 a spatial memory system for human-AI relationships. Here's what'=
s working:</div><div class=3D"paragraph"><strong>3D Home Environment</stron=
g></div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Five rooms: Living Roo=
m, Kitchen, Study, Bedroom (locked), Garden (locked)</div></li><li><div cla=
ss=3D"paragraph">Warm, Ghibli-inspired aesthetic with cream walls, honey oa=
k floors, and soft natural lighting</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">=
Time-of-day lighting system that shifts based on real-world time (morning/a=
fternoon/evening/night)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Floating dus=
t particles for atmospheric depth</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Ro=
om-to-room navigation with smooth crossfade transitions</div></li></ul><div=
 class=3D"paragraph"><strong>Conversational AI Companion (Nova)</strong></d=
iv><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Natural language chat inter=
face with typing indicators</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Intent p=
arser that understands commands like "make the wall terracotta" or "take me=
 to the kitchen"</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Smart color resolve=
r supporting 50+ color names</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Context=
-aware responses based on current room, time of day, and nearby objects</di=
v></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Nova has personality =E2=80=94 she's qu=
ietly curious, occasionally wry, remembers things gently</div></li></ul><di=
v class=3D"paragraph"><strong>Memory System</strong></div><ul start=3D"1"><=
li><div class=3D"paragraph">6 memory objects distributed across rooms (phot=
o frames, books, post-it notes, vases)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragrap=
h">Each memory has an image, title, emotional valence, patina level, and No=
va's personal recall</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Click any memor=
y object to open an inspect modal with the full story</div></li><li><div cl=
ass=3D"paragraph">Memories glow with warm golden light, pulsing subtly</div=
></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph"><strong>Onboarding</strong></div><ul st=
art=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Cinematic first arrival: "You're her=
e." with typewriter effect</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">"What do =
you want this to feel like?" =E2=80=94 your answer becomes the first wall c=
olor</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Smooth transition into the home=
</div></li></ul><div class=3D"paragraph"><strong>Furniture &amp; Objects</s=
trong></div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Couch, table, floo=
r lamp, bookshelf, bed, plant =E2=80=94 all procedurally generated in 3D</d=
iv></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph">Baseboards, floor grid, proper shadows=
 and lighting</div></li></ul><hr><h3>Architecture for Future Expansion</h3>=
<div class=3D"paragraph">The codebase is structured so the full backend can=
 be grafted on:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph"><strong>Z=
ustand store</strong> with clear slices (app, home, conversation, memory, n=
ova)</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph"><strong>Intent parser</strong> =
ready to be replaced with real LLM API calls (Claude/GPT-4o)</div></li><li>=
<div class=3D"paragraph"><strong>Environment change system</strong> that ca=
ptures all mutations for persistence</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph"=
><strong>Type definitions</strong> matching the full spec's data model</div=
></li></ul><hr><h3>What the full vision requires (next phases)</h3><div dat=
